# LF everywhere: the sample app's build checks runtime/libc.prx.sha256 byte for
# byte and runs its shell scripts in Linux, so CRLF checkouts break it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ac3 binary
*.eac3 binary
*.dts binary
*.aac binary
*.png binary
*.dds binary
*.at9 binary
*.huifont binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.thd binary
*.dtshd binary
